00:58:31,088 --> 00:58:33,288
I wanna see your smile,

922
00:58:33,588 --> 00:58:37,288
find my way to you somehow.

923
00:58:38,688 --> 00:58:40,388
take off and fly,

924
00:58:40,588 --> 00:58:42,288
the longer we wait,

925
00:58:42,488 --> 00:58:45,588
the stronger it makes us as we fight every fate,

926
00:58:45,888 --> 00:58:48,588
strength to finally defeat,

927
00:58:48,788 --> 00:58:52,288
this journey a thousand years to meet.

928
00:58:53,288 --> 00:58:55,288
let's try, it can't be denied,

929
00:58:55,588 --> 00:58:59,288
the wish in my heart is you, right here by my side,

930
00:58:59,588 --> 00:59:02,288
strength is all that we'll need,

931
00:59:02,488 --> 00:59:06,288
I won't wait a thousand years to meet.

